From: jayweihung <3034830+jayweihung@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 13:26:34 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] feat: drag from a mod onto a space in the sidebar

A mod element can start a drag inside the window with .on_drag(payload, label?).
Space groups in the agents panel and space rows in the spaces panel take it
(drag_over highlight, on_drag_drop) and hand { payload, space } to a copy of the
mod that started it, through nextDrop(). A drag started in a window overlay no
longer also moves the window.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
